@startuml
title Reservation 状态图（AI-辅助）
[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : 创建未来时段预约
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED : 模拟预付成功
PENDING_PAYMENT --> PENDING_PAYMENT : 模拟预付失败
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : 开始前取消
PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED : 支付窗口过期
CONFIRMED --> USED : 对应车牌入场核销
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : 开始前取消并退款
CONFIRMED --> EXPIRED : 到期未入场
USED --> CONFIRMED : 占位失败，核销补偿
USED --> [*] : 完成停车
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
@enduml
